# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# This project installs with yarn, and the Dockerfile runs
# `yarn install --frozen-lockfile`. A committed package-lock.json is a second
# dependency tree that nothing installs from, and Dependabot scans it: every
# advisory was reported once per lockfile, which is how 63 became 126.
package-lock.json

